WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.112
What to take into the rest of the elective.

2
00:00:02.392 --> 00:00:05.208
When a session disappoints you, locate the failure.

3
00:00:05.488 --> 00:00:13.211
Missing context (the agent couldn’t see a decision or convention) is fixed with better prompts and project memory, week 2.

4
00:00:13.491 --> 00:00:19.336
No way to check its work (it stopped when the code looked done) is fixed with tests and hooks, week 3.

5
00:00:19.616 --> 00:00:26.741
A rule broken that must never break is fixed by moving it from text the model reads to a control the harness enforces.

6
00:00:27.021 --> 00:00:33.443
And too much time or money for the task is fixed by changing the model, effort, or tool, which is lesson 3.

7
00:00:33.723 --> 00:00:38.565
Before that, lesson 2 asks how anyone knows which agents are good in the first place.
